  "question": {
    "text": "Plot of log x/m against log p is a straight line inclined at an angle of <math><mn>45</mn><mo>°</mo></math> . When the pressure is 0.5 atm and Freundlich parameter, k is 10, the amount of soluble adsorbed per gram of adsorbent will be (log 5 = 0.6990)"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "According to Freundlich equation <br/><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup></math>  <br/><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow></mrow></math>  <br/>So plot of log x/m vs log p is linear wit slope = 1/n and intercept = log k. <br/>Thus <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>°</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>  <br/>or n = 1 <br/>At p = 0.5 atm and k = 10 <br/><math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>×</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>0.5</mn><msup><mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>  <br/>so x = 5 g"
  }
